<p>ye mere laadli haye sakina</p> 
<p>chale jab aakhri ruqsat ko sarwar<br> kaha zainab se ay mazloom khwahar<br> zara le aao tum baqar ko jaakar<br> jab aaya ibne abid hukm paakar<br> kaha baqar se sheh ne gham na karna<br> ke tere saath hai meri sakina<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>ye khud pyasi rahegi dukh sahegi<br> magar pyasa tumhay rehne na degi<br> ye khud rokar tujhe rone na degi<br> ye rahe shaam may saaya karegi<br> tujhe ek pal na chodegi akela<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>kaha zainab se phir ay meri khwahar<br> chinegi jab tumhare sar se chadar<br> tamache kha ke bhi ye meri dukhtar<br> kabhi hone na degi tumko muztar<br> ye balon se karegi tumpe saaya<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>jagakar ghash se ye abid ko bolay<br> hussain ibne ali ay laal mere<br> jab hongi bediyan pairon may tere<br> sitamgar jab tujhe sonay na denge<br> karegi tauq ko ashkon se thanda<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>agarche kaan honge uske zakhmi<br> bandhi hongi galay may uske rassi<br> kayi din aur kayi shab ki ye jaagi<br> kisi pe dukh na ye zaahir karegi<br> har ek pal dhyan rakhegi tumhara<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>isay seene pe tum apne sulana<br> sare naiza mera sar na dikhana<br> hamari laash pe isko na laana<br> na dil iska kabhi zainab dukhana<br> na dekhe zakhmi akbar ka kaleja<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>ali asghar jo tha chota sa bhaiya<br> hai sar uska sina par ye na kehna<br> mila hai khaak ka isko bichono<br> tadap kar jaan dedegi sakina<br> bhala dekhegi kyun asghar ka laasha<br> ye mere laadli....</p> 
<p>ye kehkar rodiye khud shahe wala<br> likho rehan us manzar pe noha<br> raza jisko padhe qarya ba qarya<br> har ek ahle aza ho mehve girya<br> kahe maula dua degi hamesha<br> ye mere laadli....</p>